<view class="page papers-page">
  <view class="papers-head">
    <view class="papers-title">试卷库</view>
    <view class="papers-sub">网页版「智能组卷」保存的试卷，选一份直接布置</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="papers-error">{{error}}</view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading && !papers.length}}" class="papers-empty">加载中…</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{!papers.length}}" class="papers-empty">
    暂无试卷。去网页版「智能组卷」保存一份，这里就能看到。
  </view>

  <view class="papers-list">
    <view class="papers-card" wx:for="{{papers}}" wx:key="id">
      <view class="papers-card-main">
        <view class="papers-card-title">{{item.title}}</view>
        <view class="papers-card-meta">
          {{item.subject}} · {{item.count}} 题
          <text wx:if="{{item.updatedAt}}"> · {{item.updatedAt}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="papers-card-actions">
        <button class="papers-btn" size="mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onUse">一键布置</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
